## transfer

Request body, 32 bytes inline:

| Offset | Size | Field | Type |
| 0 | 2 | `address` | UInt16 |
| 8 | 16 | `write` | [UInt8] (bytes out of line) |
| 24 | 4 | `read` | UInt32 |

Reply body, 16 bytes inline:

| Offset | Size | Field | Type |
| 0 | 16 | `result` | [UInt8] (bytes out of line) |

